From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 11:19:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] test(claude-eval): G258-9 cumulative budgets for the
 passage projection

Optional operator budgets (passages per archive, total stored points
including superseded ones) refuse a projection before any change, so the
previous projection stays served. stats() reports served and superseded
points for a separate, reviewed compaction decision. Nothing is deleted.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Rv89UzspoLREq2u9UkZssh
